{"articleNo":"2754","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2754&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"열린사이버대학교(OCU) 학점교류 수강 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.09","hit":"11817","attachments":[{"name":"2011 1 유사동일교과목 목록.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=1419"},{"name":"2011 1학기 개설과목 목록.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=2509"},{"name":"2011-1 OCU 컨소시엄 수강 오리엔테이션.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=2665"},{"name":"시스템 사용료 수납방법 및 절차 안내[1].hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=2738"},{"name":"2011 OCU 학사제도 및 학사일정 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=2739"},{"name":"OCU 수강신청원 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2754&attachNo=2740"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선B’\">2011-1학기</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선B’\">열린사이버대학교(OCU) 학점교류 수강 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">학생들에게 다양한 교양교과목의 수강 선택기회를 제공하기 위하여 열린사이버대학교(OCU)와 학술교류 협약에 따라 아래와 같이 수강신청을 안내하오니 기한내에 수강&nbsp; 신청을 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 수강자격 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(3개조건 모두 충족하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 현 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균(전체학기) 3.0 이상인 자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※&nbsp; 8학기차 이상 신청자 제외&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 수강신청</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2011. 2. 17(목) ~ 2. 21(월) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강과목 : <strong>학기당 교양선택 1과목/3학점이내</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">- 교내 수강신청 포함하여 학기당 21학점 이내 신청<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 직전학기 성적 평점평균이 4.30 이상인 자는 24학점 가능)&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교내 교양필수과목과 동일 교과목은 신청할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류 :&nbsp; OCU수강신청원 [첨부서식참조]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">라. 제출장소 : 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;테크노관 행정실 ☎ 478-7359 ( 기계, 신소재(정보나노), 물리)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;디지털관 행정실 ☎ 478-7751 ( 전자, 컴퓨터, 응용수학)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;글로벌관 행정실 ☎ 478-7598 ( 건축,토목환경,산업경영,신소재,응용화학)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">3. 수강료 납부 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강료 금액 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">과목당 24,000원(본인 부담)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2010. 3. 2(수) ~ 3. 9(수), 미납시 자동 수강취소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) OCU컨소시엄 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">홈페이지(cons.ocu.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 로그인 후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[시스템사용료납부]메뉴를 이용하여 납부</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(붙임 안내참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 로그인 방법 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ID : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">kit + 학번</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; PASSWORD : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">주민번호 뒷자리</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 납부유형 : 실시간 계좌이체, 신용카드, 가상계좌(무통장입금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 납부확인 : [시스템사용료 납부 확인]메뉴에서 확인가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">4. 2011학년도 1학기 OCU 개설교과목 목록</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> : 첨부문서 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\">&nbsp; *** 기타 붙임 안내문 참조 *** <br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2011. 2. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">교무연구처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
